From 1ff0d047dbd27c061332adeccf718cea2e3537c2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 14:39:17 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Feedback group: PM playbook, Milestones tab and coaching log

For the project manager who will run the 30-person study. The playbook
(PDF + /guide/playbook, generated by scripts/guides/pm_playbook.py)
describes the six milestones, the daily and weekly rhythm, iterating
with the product team, and links each step to the admin. Version 2
gains a Milestones tab whose gates are computed by milestones() in
study.ts. Every participant page gains a coaching log (saved in this
browser until the backend exists); anyone not reached for two days
appears in This week.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Je1v64McNyB6XEu6gFgM4C
