+
+<h2 id="rhythm">6. Your day and your week</h2>
+<div class="pb-two">
+  <div><h3>A day</h3><ol class="pb-day"><li><span class="pb-time">08:30</span><div><b>Open This week</b><p>Calls first, then anyone not reached for two days, then missed questionnaires.</p><a class="pb-admin" href="/admin/experimentation/v2">Open →</a></div></li><li><span class="pb-time">09:00–11:00</span><div><b>Calls and follow-ups</b><p>Safety alerts the same day, always first. Then anyone stuck.</p></div></li><li><span class="pb-time">Each person&#x27;s time</span><div><b>One message</b><p>Short, a question, about their own goal. Template below.</p></div></li><li><span class="pb-time">Same day</span><div><b>Log it</b><p>Coaching log on their page: what they said, how they feel 1–5, the next step.</p><a class="pb-admin" href="/admin/experimentation/P01">Open →</a></div></li><li><span class="pb-time">16:30</span><div><b>Five-minute look</b><p>Wins and Engagement: who moved, who went quiet.</p><a class="pb-admin" href="/admin/experimentation/v2">Open →</a></div></li></ol></div>
+  <div><h3>A week</h3><ul class="pb-week"><li><b>Monday</b> Milestones tab: which gate is next, and is it on track?</li><li><b>Wednesday</b> Call everyone under two sessions last week.</li><li><b>Friday</b> 30 minutes with the product team: the top three findings, with who they affect.</li><li><b>Every other week</b> WHO-5 goes out; chase it within 48 hours.</li></ul>
